.TH client "2022-11-27" "1.0" "client man page"
.SH NAME
client
.SH SYNOPSIS
client [PORT] [IP ADDRESS]
.SH ARGUMENTS
client arguments:
    PORT: port number between 5000 and 64000
    IP ADDRESS: IP address of server
.SH DESCRIPTION
client connects to a server specified by the port [PORT] and ip-address [IP ADDRESS].
client takes in input Tn or Sn where Tn sends a transaction with n cpu cycles to the server and Sn makes the client wait for n nanoseconds.
client will log activity to a file named machine_name.pid
.SH SEE ALSO
server
